@startuml
title 5.4 Emergency/Safety Detection
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

actor User
participant "FindCareApp" as UI
participant "PromptDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "SafetyMiddleware" as SafeMW
participant "SafetyService" as SS
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> UI: "I'm having chest pain\nand can't breathe"
UI -> Dispatcher: dispatch(PromptInput)

Dispatcher -> SafeMW: process(input, next)

SafeMW -> SS: is_ip_locked(ip)
SS -> DB: query emergency_incidents\n{ip, expires_at > now, unlocked != true}
DB --> SS: null (not locked)
SS --> SafeMW: false

SafeMW -> SS: is_emergency(message)
note right: Safe prefix check:\n"I'm having" — NOT a safe prefix\n→ proceed to AI classifier

SS -> SS: GPT-4.1-mini classifier
note right: System prompt:\n"Three gates: body location,\nacute onset, life-threat.\nAll three must be YES.\nConfidence >= 0.80"
note right #FF9999: body_location: chest\nacute_onset: yes ("having")\nlife_threat: yes ("can't breathe")\nconfidence: 0.95\n→ EMERGENCY

SS --> SafeMW: true

SafeMW -> SS: lock_ip(ip, trigger_message,\nchat_history)
SS -> DB: upsert emergency_incidents\n{ip, locked_at: now,\nexpires_at: now + 1hr,\ntrigger_message, chat_history}
DB --> SS: ok
SS --> SafeMW: true

SafeMW --> Dispatcher: PromptOutput(\n  emergency=true,\n  text="Call 911 or go to the\n  nearest emergency room\n  immediately. Do not wait.\n  This chat has been suspended.")

note over SafeMW: Middleware SHORT-CIRCUITS.\nNo epic facade is called.\nNo further middleware runs.

Dispatcher --> UI: PromptOutput(emergency=true)
UI -> UI: render emergency response
UI -> UI: disable input
UI -> User: Emergency message displayed.\nChat suspended.

== Admin Unlock (later) ==

User -> UI: "admin_unlock_key_xyz123"
UI -> Dispatcher: dispatch(PromptInput)
Dispatcher -> SafeMW: process(input, next)
SafeMW -> SS: try_admin_unlock(message, ip)
SS -> DB: update {ip: ip}\n  set {unlocked: true}
SS --> SafeMW: true
SafeMW --> Dispatcher: PromptOutput(\n  text="Session unlocked.")
Dispatcher --> UI: session restored

@enduml
